WEBVTT

01:31.440 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:39.800 --> 01:41.080
Make the same gesture as mine,

01:41.600 --> 01:43.160
and you will be teleported.

01:46.720 --> 01:47.640
Nan Xuyue.

01:52.120 --> 01:53.000
Thank you.

02:26.080 --> 02:26.920
Xie Xuechen.

02:31.280 --> 02:32.120
Are you okay?

02:32.200 --> 02:33.400
Why am I here?

02:33.480 --> 02:34.480
You don't remember?

02:37.040 --> 02:38.040
So,

02:39.440 --> 02:40.520
I'm possessed by the Dark Clan again?

02:41.640 --> 02:42.480
Have you thought about it?

02:43.360 --> 02:45.480
If you tell me the whereabouts
of the Chaos Pearl,

02:46.000 --> 02:48.280
I'll open the Immortals Array for you

02:48.360 --> 02:51.480
and turn that foul and sinful place
into a burning inferno

02:51.560 --> 02:53.480
to help you fulfill your vengeance.

02:54.320 --> 02:55.640
Simple enough deal,

02:56.520 --> 02:57.480
isn't it?

03:01.920 --> 03:03.400
Who are you?

03:04.680 --> 03:06.480
Why can you open the Immortals Array?

03:08.160 --> 03:10.440
The Immortals Array was created
by the Chaos Power.

03:10.520 --> 03:12.920
Over the years,
it has lost much of its power.

03:13.000 --> 03:15.360
With the right measures
in the right place,

03:15.440 --> 03:17.160
we can break it.

03:18.360 --> 03:19.600
Back then,

03:19.680 --> 03:22.000
I had the honor of seeing it
when the Immortals Array

03:22.080 --> 03:23.320
was created by the Immortal Alliance,

03:24.280 --> 03:27.880
so I knew where to break it.

03:29.560 --> 03:30.440
Back then?

03:31.680 --> 03:32.920
Six thousand years ago?

03:34.680 --> 03:35.520
No.

03:36.160 --> 03:38.200
You're even more than 6,000 years old,

03:42.440 --> 03:44.880
but that's no longer my concern.

03:46.960 --> 03:48.960
The Chaos Pearl was destroyed

03:50.360 --> 03:51.760
by Gao Fengxu.

03:53.600 --> 03:55.520
The Chaos Pearl is divine

03:56.120 --> 03:57.800
and impossible to be destroyed.

03:58.320 --> 04:01.200
You and I don't have much time,

04:01.960 --> 04:04.440
so we shouldn't waste it on this nonsense.

04:05.400 --> 04:07.800
Believe it or not, it's up to you.

04:09.520 --> 04:10.400
Good.

04:11.800 --> 04:13.640
On that day,
in Mirage Palace and Starfall Valley,

04:14.440 --> 04:16.600
there were five people
who survived at the end.

04:17.279 --> 04:19.600
You all know
where the Chaos Pearl is, right?

04:20.240 --> 04:22.240
It's okay if you don't tell me.

04:23.360 --> 04:25.800
You're not my only choice.

04:33.240 --> 04:34.200
Okay.

04:35.560 --> 04:37.440
It's time for me to carry out my plan.

04:38.480 --> 04:39.440
Sang Qi.

04:40.920 --> 04:42.480
You and I were allies,

04:44.160 --> 04:45.360
so I may miss you

04:46.120 --> 04:47.840
after you die.

05:10.600 --> 05:12.560
Who is He Xianwo?

05:13.080 --> 05:15.600
Why does he know the way
to open the Immortals Array?

05:18.200 --> 05:21.200
When Feng Xiang and Qian Guang
were building the Immortals Array,

05:21.280 --> 05:22.360
he was snooping around,

05:23.440 --> 05:26.600
so he spied on the steps and breakthroughs
to build the Immortals Array.

05:26.680 --> 05:27.760
How is this possible?

05:28.520 --> 05:29.840
The Immortals Array

05:29.920 --> 05:31.480
was built 6,000 years ago.

05:31.560 --> 05:32.360
Break.

05:37.120 --> 05:38.360
Nothing

05:38.880 --> 05:40.840
in this world is impossible.

05:45.440 --> 05:46.640
Immortals Array's barrier is broken.

05:46.720 --> 05:48.440
I need to fix it as soon as possible.

05:49.400 --> 05:50.760
If the Immortals Array is really opened,

05:51.720 --> 05:53.520
will the Immortal Alliance
be able to handle it?

05:54.880 --> 05:57.080
The Mirage Palace and the Xuantian Sect

05:57.600 --> 05:59.840
were greatly wounded
in the previous battle.

06:00.560 --> 06:01.800
Now, they have no leader,

06:02.560 --> 06:03.920
so they are unable to cope.

06:04.440 --> 06:07.760
I've heard that Jade Sky Palace alone
has 5,000 direct disciples

06:07.840 --> 06:09.080
and over 10,000 external friars,

06:09.160 --> 06:11.640
so I think they can fight.

06:11.720 --> 06:13.320
Jade Sky Palace?

06:14.160 --> 06:15.600
They're only looking out for themselves,

06:15.680 --> 06:16.840
and this time,

06:16.920 --> 06:18.600
they probably won't go all out
against the enemy,

06:18.680 --> 06:20.600
so how can we hope for that?

06:21.200 --> 06:23.160
Osprey Island is the attacker,

06:23.240 --> 06:24.480
so isn't Snow City the only one

06:24.560 --> 06:27.600
who can fight
with their backs to the wall?

06:28.480 --> 06:31.240
With the Spirit Clan
and the Dark Clan joining forces,

06:31.320 --> 06:32.440
even Snow City

06:33.040 --> 06:35.000
will run out of steam in the end.

06:36.560 --> 06:37.640
In this battle,

06:38.160 --> 06:39.720
the Immortal Alliance
will be in a very bad way.

06:40.400 --> 06:42.480
Then why do you still have time
to draw here?

06:46.600 --> 06:48.960
I'm just following my own plan.

07:02.800 --> 07:05.160
This time, the Immortals Array
is not rupturing externally.

07:05.840 --> 07:07.360
It appears
that its barrier has been opened.

07:07.880 --> 07:09.640
If the rift grows
and the Dark Clan discovers it,

07:10.320 --> 07:12.120
they'll do whatever it takes

07:12.200 --> 07:13.280
to get all out.

07:13.360 --> 07:15.320
I'm afraid we can't stop them

07:15.840 --> 07:17.760
with just you and me.

07:21.080 --> 07:22.400
I'm going into the Dark Abyss.

07:22.480 --> 07:23.800
Even if I can't stop Sang Qi,

07:24.520 --> 07:26.360
I can earn some time to fix the Barrier.

07:28.880 --> 07:30.240
You have already betrayed the Dark Abyss,

07:30.760 --> 07:32.000
so they won't show you any mercy.

07:34.720 --> 07:36.000
In all these years,

07:36.520 --> 07:38.560
Sang Qi never really wanted to kill me.

07:38.640 --> 07:40.520
After what happened to Su Ningxi,

07:40.600 --> 07:42.680
I know even more
that he is not a heartless man.

07:42.760 --> 07:44.120
Xie Xuechen.

07:44.640 --> 07:46.280
I will guard the human world with you.

07:47.520 --> 07:48.720
Will you trust me?

07:50.840 --> 07:52.040
Be careful.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.680
I'll come to you
after I mend the Immortals Array.

08:02.320 --> 08:03.440
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

08:03.520 --> 08:04.400
Master.

08:07.040 --> 08:07.880
Master.

08:10.240 --> 08:11.720
He Xianwo
broke the Immortals Array's barrier.

08:12.440 --> 08:13.480
The Dark Clan is moving strangely.

08:14.000 --> 08:15.400
Please make them stop.

08:20.000 --> 08:21.440
Now,

08:23.040 --> 08:24.480
they will not obey me.

08:25.440 --> 08:27.840
They only obey the strong.

08:28.360 --> 08:29.520
Always like this.

08:37.760 --> 08:40.640
The Disillusion Water
has finally been undone.

08:42.000 --> 08:43.159
You, like me,

08:43.679 --> 08:45.560
gave your heart to the Humans

08:45.640 --> 08:48.200
like a moth to a flame,

08:49.320 --> 08:50.320
but you

08:51.320 --> 08:52.600
are luckier

08:56.120 --> 08:58.800
and different.

08:58.880 --> 09:00.440
Tell me.

09:00.520 --> 09:01.640
Why did you come back?

09:01.720 --> 09:03.200
Aren't you afraid I'll kill you

09:03.720 --> 09:07.200
or tell someone who you are?

09:07.880 --> 09:09.040
Because I'm betting on it.

09:11.360 --> 09:13.080
You're the only person in the world

09:13.960 --> 09:16.280
I can feel any kind of kinship with.

09:17.040 --> 09:17.960
I was betting

09:18.560 --> 09:19.960
that you'd do the same for me,

09:20.040 --> 09:22.120
that you wouldn't really hurt me,

09:24.520 --> 09:27.240
and that you'd be willing to help me.

09:54.040 --> 09:55.680
I'm glad

09:57.440 --> 09:59.520
to hear you say that,

10:18.720 --> 10:20.160
but I

10:21.280 --> 10:22.880
can't go back.

10:26.320 --> 10:27.320
Master.

10:32.560 --> 10:33.400
Master.

10:41.440 --> 10:42.240
Master.

10:45.800 --> 10:46.880
Master.

10:48.000 --> 10:50.960
I've had a hard life

10:51.920 --> 10:53.600
and am coming to the end of it,

10:54.520 --> 10:55.480
but you

10:56.280 --> 10:57.800
still have choices.

10:59.320 --> 11:00.520
I

11:01.560 --> 11:03.240
wish you

11:04.120 --> 11:06.000
a straight road ahead.

11:07.920 --> 11:08.960
Master.

11:17.320 --> 11:18.160
Master.

12:12.240 --> 12:13.640
Where are your ears?

12:16.680 --> 12:18.640
You're awake. Are you thirsty?

12:18.720 --> 12:19.680
Have some water.

12:22.160 --> 12:24.360
Are you hungry? Want some fish?

12:31.000 --> 12:32.080
Who are you?

12:32.160 --> 12:33.280
What do you want?

12:37.640 --> 12:39.080
What do I want?

12:39.600 --> 12:42.120
You and I met in the woods,
and you brought me here.

12:42.200 --> 12:43.720
Have you forgotten?

12:45.600 --> 12:47.440
I am Su Ningxi,
a disciple of the Mirage Palace.

12:48.080 --> 12:51.280
The reason why you brought me here
is that I could heal you.

12:58.080 --> 12:58.920
I am the Spirit Clan,

12:59.520 --> 13:02.480
but why didn't you kill me or send word?

13:02.560 --> 13:04.280
Why would I kill you?

13:04.360 --> 13:05.640
You are strange.

13:06.280 --> 13:07.840
Your wound is bleeding.

13:07.920 --> 13:09.080
Let me take care of that for you.

13:40.960 --> 13:42.000
You're hurt too badly.

13:42.600 --> 13:43.800
I'm exhausted today

13:44.520 --> 13:46.560
and need a night's rest to recover.

14:26.800 --> 14:28.400
She's just sleeping.

14:48.920 --> 14:51.680
I didn't realize you saved this rabbit

14:51.760 --> 14:53.120
just to eat it.

14:55.840 --> 14:57.160
It smells good.

15:04.080 --> 15:06.200
The rabbit is so cute,
so it's really delicious.

15:07.280 --> 15:08.200
Don't you think you're cruel?

15:08.280 --> 15:10.160
But I have to live.

15:10.680 --> 15:12.760
Can you eat other living beings
just to stay alive?

15:13.600 --> 15:15.320
What if I eat you to stay alive?

15:16.760 --> 15:18.680
Then you'd better be quick.
Don't make me feel pain.

15:21.520 --> 15:23.480
-And?
-And

15:23.560 --> 15:24.680
Add more cumin.

15:24.760 --> 15:25.960
It'll taste better.

15:29.160 --> 15:31.480
I doubt you're not human.

15:32.480 --> 15:34.280
I also doubt you're not a werewolf.

15:39.800 --> 15:42.640
Weren't you afraid or hated me when I said

15:43.920 --> 15:45.080
I was going to eat you?

15:45.160 --> 15:46.680
You were just trying to survive.

15:50.720 --> 15:51.560
No.

15:54.440 --> 15:56.160
I am the demidemon of the Spirit Clan.

15:57.720 --> 15:59.040
I was born guilty.

16:00.960 --> 16:01.800
I am evil,

16:03.400 --> 16:04.520
bloodthirsty,

16:05.280 --> 16:06.120
cruel,

16:07.960 --> 16:09.400
and cold.

16:14.000 --> 16:15.360
In God's mind,

16:15.440 --> 16:18.240
what difference does every race make?

16:23.560 --> 16:24.880
Listen.

16:25.400 --> 16:26.920
Grass breaks through rocks

16:27.000 --> 16:28.120
and soil in order to grow.

16:28.720 --> 16:31.120
Rabbits eat grass to grow.

16:31.640 --> 16:33.520
Beasts eat meat, and people eat beasts.

16:33.600 --> 16:34.640
And yet,

16:34.720 --> 16:38.040
even the most powerful beings
on earth die,

16:38.120 --> 16:39.040
are buried in the ground,

16:39.120 --> 16:40.600
and become nutrients
for the grass and trees.

16:42.480 --> 16:44.280
Everything is born with a purpose.

16:44.920 --> 16:46.040
It's not about good or evil

16:46.680 --> 16:48.000
or strength.

16:49.520 --> 16:52.560
Demidemon's existence
has an essential meaning.

16:53.320 --> 16:56.720
The disdain for life
is not God's will but the will of humans.

17:00.520 --> 17:02.400
Humans need to eat

17:02.480 --> 17:04.480
a lot of life to survive.

17:04.560 --> 17:06.560
This rabbit that I ate is the same

17:06.640 --> 17:08.200
as me who will be eaten by you,

17:09.119 --> 17:11.319
but I will honor every life that I eat.

17:11.400 --> 17:13.280
No matter how bad it is to eat,

17:13.359 --> 17:14.599
I can't waste them

17:14.680 --> 17:16.400
or fail every life,

17:18.640 --> 17:20.920
so I'm afraid of being eaten by you,

17:22.079 --> 17:23.319
but I won't hate you.

17:25.599 --> 17:26.560
Maybe

17:27.079 --> 17:28.800
that's why I met you.

17:35.280 --> 17:36.280
Sang Qi.

17:37.280 --> 17:38.920
I'm really happy to have met you.

17:40.640 --> 17:42.040
You may not know

17:42.920 --> 17:43.760
that actually,

17:45.200 --> 17:46.480
you're very gentle.

18:38.520 --> 18:39.800
This is the place

18:40.880 --> 18:43.280
we once agreed to leave together.

18:45.000 --> 18:46.720
It's still beautiful

18:48.160 --> 18:49.520
after all these years,

18:51.480 --> 18:52.600
isn't it?

19:09.720 --> 19:10.880
This sword

19:12.000 --> 19:13.600
is a witness to our love for each other

19:19.440 --> 19:21.560
and our misunderstandings.

19:25.880 --> 19:27.160
Those joys,

19:28.360 --> 19:30.600
sorrows, pains,

19:31.480 --> 19:32.560
and resentments

19:35.360 --> 19:36.960
should be forgotten

19:38.360 --> 19:39.920
by now.

20:00.560 --> 20:02.640
I know you don't like killing,

20:04.920 --> 20:07.400
but I'm not a good person after all.

20:17.520 --> 20:19.120
Because of my resentment,

20:20.120 --> 20:21.240
I have done many wrong things

20:22.120 --> 20:23.800
over the years.

20:26.400 --> 20:27.720
When I see you again,

20:29.280 --> 20:30.680
I will beg for your forgiveness.

20:35.920 --> 20:37.640
It's all my fault.

20:39.360 --> 20:40.840
If I had trusted you,

20:42.840 --> 20:44.960
we would not have been separated,

20:48.560 --> 20:51.920
and you would not have suffered so much.

21:33.120 --> 21:34.360
Ningxi.

22:17.800 --> 22:18.880
Sang Qi.

22:52.600 --> 22:53.680
Sang Qi.

22:54.560 --> 22:56.120
I love you most.

23:24.720 --> 23:26.040
Master.

23:29.240 --> 23:30.440
Demidemons like us

23:30.960 --> 23:32.600
are born to be disliked.

23:33.240 --> 23:34.120
We have no birthday

23:35.000 --> 23:36.160
or name.

23:37.000 --> 23:39.760
I was abandoned
under the Fusang Tree on Qi Road…

23:39.840 --> 23:41.640
TWILIGHT SPIRIT PAVILION

23:41.720 --> 23:43.640
…so I named myself Sang Qi.

23:45.920 --> 23:48.200
You were Malvaviscus at the time
of the demon's coming,

23:48.280 --> 23:49.720
so your name

23:49.800 --> 23:51.240
is Mu Xuanling.

23:51.320 --> 23:53.080
Today, I accept you as my disciple.

23:53.600 --> 23:54.560
From now on,

23:55.560 --> 23:56.600
the Dark Abyss

23:57.560 --> 23:59.680
is your shelter.

24:01.360 --> 24:02.200
Ling.

24:02.960 --> 24:05.160
I noticed you

24:05.800 --> 24:07.680
in Moonlight Heights ten years ago

24:09.120 --> 24:11.280
because I saw myself

24:11.960 --> 24:13.400
in you.

24:15.240 --> 24:17.480
If Ningxi and I had a child,

24:19.200 --> 24:21.440
he or she would be just like you.

24:34.280 --> 24:36.200
Now is not the time to be sad.

24:36.720 --> 24:39.080
I have important things to do.

24:41.280 --> 24:42.120
Thank you, Mr. Xie.

24:42.640 --> 24:45.360
Xuantian Sect has come here for support
after Elder Cang's message.

24:45.960 --> 24:47.840
The Immortals Array
is about to be broken open

24:47.920 --> 24:49.480
beyond repair.

24:49.560 --> 24:51.760
The Dark Clan is alive and endless.

24:51.840 --> 24:53.240
If they break out of the Immortals Array,

24:53.960 --> 24:55.040
we will not be able to kill them all.

24:55.960 --> 24:56.960
Now,

24:57.480 --> 24:58.720
we can only stop the Dark Clan

24:59.760 --> 25:02.320
from coming back at all
by sealing the Void Sea.

25:04.640 --> 25:06.400
Sealing the Void Sea is not an easy task,

25:07.000 --> 25:09.240
and we need to consume a huge amount
of spiritual power to have a chance.

25:09.960 --> 25:12.160
If I use all my spiritual power,
I can fight them.

25:13.320 --> 25:14.320
Thank you, Saint.

25:14.840 --> 25:16.520
Continue to control the barriers
with the curse.

25:17.920 --> 25:19.240
I'm going into the Dark Abyss

25:19.840 --> 25:21.480
to seal the Void Sea.

25:21.560 --> 25:22.760
Mr. Xie, be careful.

25:24.720 --> 25:26.240
The Spirit Clan has attacked the city.

25:26.320 --> 25:28.520
Execute all the spirit slaves.

25:28.600 --> 25:29.600
All of them.

25:30.440 --> 25:31.400
The Master said

25:31.480 --> 25:33.680
we'd just put them in the dungeon
and keep them under close guard.

25:33.760 --> 25:35.760
If they collude
with the Spirit Clan in a riot,

25:35.840 --> 25:36.680
we will all die.

25:37.240 --> 25:38.440
Do it.

25:41.400 --> 25:42.240
Who?

25:43.600 --> 25:44.640
Who are you?

25:51.600 --> 25:52.640
Who is he?

25:53.600 --> 25:55.280
-Who?
-Who is he?

25:59.880 --> 26:01.440
You are free,

26:02.160 --> 26:03.560
but

26:04.800 --> 26:06.760
if you don't want this hard-won freedom

26:06.840 --> 26:07.840
to disappear again,

26:08.440 --> 26:10.360
I need a small favor from all of you.

26:10.960 --> 26:13.720
My fighters of the Spirit Clan
have stormed the city.

26:14.320 --> 26:15.640
If you are willing to join forces with me,

26:15.720 --> 26:17.800
we can pick each other up

26:19.040 --> 26:21.040
and destroy Jade Sky Palace once
and for all.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.320
Xuanling.

26:37.360 --> 26:39.160
-Are you all right?
-Yes, I am.

26:42.120 --> 26:43.640
It seems you and I share a common bond

26:44.160 --> 26:45.760
and have come here for the same purpose.

26:45.840 --> 26:47.520
If I hadn't come here,

26:48.280 --> 26:50.280
would you have used up
your spiritual power

26:50.360 --> 26:51.800
to seal the Void Sea again?

26:51.880 --> 26:53.440
The Immortals Array is about to be broken,

26:53.960 --> 26:55.400
so this is the only way
to stop the Dark Clan.

27:01.280 --> 27:03.040
Perhaps there is a better way.

27:06.280 --> 27:07.560
Master died,

27:08.280 --> 27:09.600
but he left his spiritual essence to me.

27:09.680 --> 27:11.080
His spiritual essence

27:11.160 --> 27:12.880
has gathered a lot of demonic energy
from the Void Sea,

27:13.560 --> 27:15.120
and it has
the Jade Vault Technique's power,

27:15.200 --> 27:17.640
so it might be able
to seal the Void Sea for a while.

27:18.240 --> 27:20.480
If we use the Jade Vault Technique
to purify Sang Qi's spiritual essence

27:21.120 --> 27:22.520
and turn the demonic energy
into spiritual power,

27:23.040 --> 27:24.480
we can seal the Void Sea.

27:28.840 --> 27:30.600
Immortals Array is damaged.

27:30.680 --> 27:32.000
This is a great opportunity.

27:32.600 --> 27:34.200
We can eliminate the Humans

27:34.280 --> 27:36.320
before we fight for supremacy.

27:36.400 --> 27:38.240
Gentlemen of the Dark Clan, listen up.

27:38.320 --> 27:39.200
Let's go.

27:39.280 --> 27:40.480
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

27:40.560 --> 27:43.680
It seems the Dark Clan has discovered
the Immortals Array is broken.

27:43.760 --> 27:44.960
The barrier won't last long.

27:45.040 --> 27:46.200
Let's get started.

28:09.360 --> 28:11.280
Slaughter the Immortal Alliance.

28:12.080 --> 28:12.920
Seize the human realm.

28:13.000 --> 28:16.240
Charge!

28:16.320 --> 28:17.520
Calm down.

28:17.600 --> 28:18.480
Remove distractions.

28:18.560 --> 28:19.480
Hold the barrier.

28:34.240 --> 28:35.480
JADE SKY PALACE

29:00.600 --> 29:01.600
Honey.

29:12.240 --> 29:13.160
Didn't I tell you to take our son away?

29:13.760 --> 29:14.760
Why have you come here?

29:15.480 --> 29:16.360
Having been married all these years,

29:16.440 --> 29:18.320
I've gotten nothing

29:18.400 --> 29:19.880
and suffered every day,

29:20.480 --> 29:21.640
so if anything happens to you,

29:21.720 --> 29:24.000
I've lost a lot in the deal.

29:25.600 --> 29:27.320
Is one life worth more or two?

29:27.920 --> 29:29.440
Can't you even do the math?

29:29.960 --> 29:32.360
Sometimes, it's not the right way
of doing the math.

29:33.480 --> 29:34.360
-Attack!
-Careful.

29:48.400 --> 29:51.920
If I'd known, I wouldn't
have gotten drunk on business.

29:53.040 --> 29:54.520
I should have practiced.

29:54.600 --> 29:57.880
It's just a deal, so why so serious?

29:59.040 --> 30:00.160
What if

30:00.680 --> 30:01.880
it's not just a deal?

30:05.040 --> 30:06.240
Fool.

30:13.200 --> 30:14.040
Father. Mother.

30:17.720 --> 30:18.760
-Go after them.
-Go after them.

30:19.880 --> 30:20.720
Mother.

30:21.240 --> 30:22.520
Sheng. Help your mother.

30:24.040 --> 30:27.480
The Spirit Clan has come in force
and is unusual,

30:27.560 --> 30:29.080
so something must be wrong.

30:29.160 --> 30:30.560
-I'm going to send a message
-Mother.

30:30.640 --> 30:31.680
to all the sects to find out
what's going on.

30:31.760 --> 30:33.760
But you don't have a chance.

30:35.720 --> 30:36.560
Jiang Li.

30:59.560 --> 31:01.040
The Decaying Immortal Pavilion
has colluded

31:01.120 --> 31:01.960
with the Dark Clan to murder your kind.

31:02.040 --> 31:03.320
What do you want?

31:03.400 --> 31:04.600
Fu Yuanting.

31:04.680 --> 31:07.480
When the Immortal Alliance
set up the Spirit Management Bureau

31:07.560 --> 31:09.960
and brutalized the Spirit Clan,

31:10.040 --> 31:11.880
why didn't you fight for it?

31:11.960 --> 31:13.120
The Decaying Immortal Pavilion

31:13.200 --> 31:15.040
was only fixing the wrongs of this world.

31:15.120 --> 31:16.360
You are all part

31:16.880 --> 31:18.160
of the wrong.

31:18.240 --> 31:19.680
The Spirit Management Bureau

31:19.760 --> 31:21.480
was created to restrain the Spirit Clan

31:21.560 --> 31:23.400
that was a danger to the Humans.

31:24.120 --> 31:26.720
The Jade Sky Palace was chosen
as the keeper of order

31:26.800 --> 31:28.600
and has run the Spirit Management Bureau
for generations.

31:29.240 --> 31:32.120
They have restricted
the Spirit Clan's freedom a little,

31:32.200 --> 31:36.480
but over the years, they have kept
the Humans and the Spirit Clan in peace.

31:36.560 --> 31:38.120
Isn't that a good thing?

31:38.200 --> 31:39.640
A good thing?

31:40.560 --> 31:41.600
It seems, Elder Duan,

31:41.680 --> 31:43.000
that you don't think

31:43.080 --> 31:44.720
what you're doing is wrong.

31:45.240 --> 31:46.480
Then I would like to ask.

31:47.200 --> 31:49.080
The Humans discriminate
against the Spirit Clan

31:49.160 --> 31:51.880
and kill and repress them with impunity.

31:52.400 --> 31:53.920
Does this mean that the Humans

31:54.680 --> 31:56.760
are inherently more noble
than the Spirit Clan?

31:57.520 --> 31:58.920
Jade Sky Palace is like this,

31:59.000 --> 32:00.040
and so is Mirage Palace

32:00.120 --> 32:01.560
and the Immortal Alliance.

32:01.640 --> 32:03.240
You're all glamorous on the outside

32:03.320 --> 32:04.960
but rotten on the inside.

32:05.040 --> 32:07.000
Where is the future of the Spirit Clan

32:07.520 --> 32:09.320
if you are not destroyed?

32:13.800 --> 32:15.040
Jiang Li.

32:15.120 --> 32:16.000
We can talk.

32:16.080 --> 32:17.760
You've treated Bao well,

32:17.840 --> 32:18.760
so I don't want to kill you.

32:18.840 --> 32:19.560
Get out of the way.

32:29.200 --> 32:31.040
-Sheng.
-Sheng.

32:31.120 --> 32:31.960
Brother.

32:32.480 --> 32:34.640
-Sheng, get up.
-Brother, get up.

32:36.440 --> 32:37.480
Bao.

32:38.280 --> 32:39.120
Come to me.

32:39.200 --> 32:41.600
Bad guy. You're not my father.

32:41.680 --> 32:43.000
My father is Fu Cangli.

32:43.080 --> 32:45.960
He's the richest friar in the world.

32:46.040 --> 32:47.000
My mother says

32:47.080 --> 32:49.280
my father is kind and nice to everyone,

32:49.360 --> 32:50.640
unlike you.

32:53.680 --> 32:54.520
You…

32:55.720 --> 32:56.640
You're Cangli?

32:58.680 --> 32:59.760
Father.

33:00.360 --> 33:01.360
You know Fu Cangli?

33:01.960 --> 33:02.880
Who is he?

33:03.600 --> 33:05.640
-He…
-What?

33:06.160 --> 33:07.800
You're afraid to say it?

33:08.920 --> 33:10.280
Then I'll say it for you.

33:10.360 --> 33:12.320
How did the former head
of Jade Sky Palace,

33:12.400 --> 33:13.640
your brother,

33:13.720 --> 33:15.160
my father,

33:15.680 --> 33:16.920
Fu Chengzhou,

33:17.440 --> 33:18.480
die?

33:19.600 --> 33:21.640
If it wasn't for the chaos
of Jade Sky Palace due to the conspiracy

33:21.720 --> 33:23.320
and you killed your brother
in order to take over the throne,

33:23.840 --> 33:26.360
which caused my mother and me
to change our names

33:26.440 --> 33:27.960
and to be displaced,

33:29.200 --> 33:31.680
how did I, Jiang Li,
get to where I am today?

33:32.680 --> 33:33.520
Father.

33:37.600 --> 33:38.640
None of what he said

33:39.840 --> 33:40.680
is true,

33:41.760 --> 33:42.680
is it?

33:45.200 --> 33:48.040
That's the truth, isn't it?

33:48.560 --> 33:49.400
Master Fu?

33:52.480 --> 33:53.520
No.

33:56.080 --> 33:57.040
Back then,

33:57.960 --> 33:59.720
it was Fu Chengzhou

33:59.800 --> 34:00.640
who killed and seized power,

34:01.520 --> 34:02.520
not Fu Yuanting.

34:02.600 --> 34:03.840
You…

34:03.920 --> 34:04.760
You knew that?

34:05.480 --> 34:07.000
I've known for a long time,

34:07.520 --> 34:09.960
but you didn't want anyone to know,
so I was just pretending not to know.

34:11.600 --> 34:13.840
Mother. What's going on?

34:13.920 --> 34:15.280
What are you hiding?

34:15.360 --> 34:16.840
Honey.

34:18.000 --> 34:20.760
Things are like this now,
so do we have to hide it now?

34:20.840 --> 34:23.520
Maybe you were wrong from the beginning.
He deserves to know the truth.

34:27.480 --> 34:28.480
Back then,

34:29.320 --> 34:30.679
Jade Sky Palace
was on the verge of collapse.

34:31.280 --> 34:34.480
The one who worked day and night
on a new artifact to support the palace

34:34.560 --> 34:36.440
was not Fu Chengzhou but Fu Yuanting.

34:37.360 --> 34:38.560
He was also the one

34:39.159 --> 34:40.600
who was associated
with my clan by marriage

34:41.120 --> 34:42.639
and saved Jade Sky Palace,

34:43.400 --> 34:46.480
so your grandfather
appointed him as the heir,

34:46.560 --> 34:48.520
but your father was angry

34:48.600 --> 34:50.000
and tried to kill his brother
to seize power.

34:50.800 --> 34:52.920
In the end,
he was killed by your grandfather.

34:54.239 --> 34:55.159
This fool,

34:56.440 --> 34:58.680
to save your grandfather's
and father's reputations,

34:59.280 --> 35:00.640
hid the truth

35:01.560 --> 35:03.200
and was willing to let the world criticize

35:03.800 --> 35:04.920
and misunderstand him.

35:06.000 --> 35:07.120
Was it worth it?

35:09.360 --> 35:12.120
You were young when it happened,

35:12.200 --> 35:14.040
and your mother didn't know the truth,

35:14.120 --> 35:15.360
so she took you on the run

35:15.440 --> 35:17.640
and never showed up again.

35:18.920 --> 35:20.040
But Cangli,

35:20.600 --> 35:21.440
do you know why your name

35:21.520 --> 35:24.040
is not on the family tree
of The Fu family?

35:24.960 --> 35:27.280
It's because your uncle
wanted to protect you.

35:28.960 --> 35:31.200
He erased everything

35:31.840 --> 35:33.800
to save you from being used
by your enemies

35:34.360 --> 35:37.120
and the strife from hatred,

35:38.200 --> 35:39.600
but after all these years,

35:40.280 --> 35:42.160
he has been waiting for you to come home.

35:42.240 --> 35:43.440
You must realize

35:44.720 --> 35:47.840
that Fu Yuanting is your uncle,
not your enemy.

35:47.920 --> 35:49.080
Do you understand?

36:00.280 --> 36:02.280
What's the point

36:03.880 --> 36:04.880
of you telling me this now?

36:06.120 --> 36:07.080
I can tell you

36:07.880 --> 36:09.400
that what I am doing now

36:11.440 --> 36:13.080
is not because of family hatred

36:14.400 --> 36:16.360
but because
the Immortal Alliance must die.

36:16.440 --> 36:17.760
Do not harm them.

36:21.880 --> 36:23.160
Having been with the Humans long enough,

36:25.640 --> 36:26.880
you want to help them now.

36:31.360 --> 36:32.280
Whatever.

36:33.440 --> 36:34.520
In the future,

36:35.120 --> 36:36.840
you'll understand my good intentions.

36:38.720 --> 36:41.120
Whatever you want to do, do it to me.

36:41.640 --> 36:43.280
This has nothing to do with them.

36:43.920 --> 36:45.880
You… Don't hurt them.

36:51.720 --> 36:53.120
Father, Mother.

36:53.200 --> 36:54.360
-Bao.
-Bao.

37:00.800 --> 37:02.080
What's going on?

37:02.160 --> 37:04.160
Someone opened the secret passage's
self-destruct array.

37:04.800 --> 37:05.640
How can we escape?

37:05.720 --> 37:08.440
Once the array is opened,
no one can escape.

37:10.080 --> 37:11.320
Jiang Li is still inside.

37:11.400 --> 37:13.680
He's helped us so much,
but we're biting the hand.

37:13.760 --> 37:14.920
Isn't that too bad?

37:15.000 --> 37:16.840
As a member of the Humans,

37:16.920 --> 37:18.360
Jiang Li won't represent the interests
of the Spirit Clan.

37:18.440 --> 37:20.200
He'll betray us sooner or later,

37:20.280 --> 37:21.680
so we'd better get rid of him

37:22.640 --> 37:23.960
and let him die

37:24.880 --> 37:26.280
with the Jade Sky Palace.

37:42.800 --> 37:45.000
They won't last long.
The curse barrier is the weakest here.

37:45.080 --> 37:46.200
Let's work together to tear it down.

37:47.160 --> 37:48.000
That's good.

37:48.080 --> 37:49.720
After we break out of the barrier,

37:49.800 --> 37:51.800
let's start with the Xuantian Sect.

37:56.800 --> 37:58.000
Senior.

37:58.080 --> 38:00.000
Immortals Array's barrier
is almost destroyed,

38:00.720 --> 38:01.960
so by relying on the Curse alone,

38:02.040 --> 38:02.880
the spiritual power
will eventually run out.

38:02.960 --> 38:04.800
Once the curse barrier is broken,

38:04.880 --> 38:06.160
we won't be able to stop the Dark Clan.

38:06.760 --> 38:07.920
Don't think about the result.

38:08.440 --> 38:09.480
Defend until the end.

38:09.560 --> 38:10.720
Yes, sir.

38:25.520 --> 38:26.880
The barrier has been broken.

38:27.480 --> 38:28.320
Let's get out of here.

38:54.240 --> 38:54.960
Run!

38:55.480 --> 38:57.480
-Run!
-Run!

39:30.760 --> 39:32.880
I don't know if the Dark Clan
escaped from the Two Realms Mountain.

39:33.960 --> 39:35.680
Xuanxin and the others
are still in the Immortals Array.

39:35.760 --> 39:37.160
Let's go join them.

39:40.360 --> 39:41.200
What's going on?

39:42.400 --> 39:43.800
Something's not right with the Dark Abyss.

39:50.760 --> 39:51.720
Old friend.

39:54.760 --> 39:55.960
Xie Xuechen.

39:59.160 --> 40:01.240
It's him again. Come on. Let's go.

41:25.520 --> 41:26.560
Long time no see.

41:31.280 --> 41:32.360
You…

41:38.640 --> 41:39.600
You're finally here.

41:40.760 --> 41:41.600
Pearl.

41:42.600 --> 41:43.760
Pearl.

41:51.080 --> 41:52.320
Is that you?

41:53.800 --> 41:54.960
Mister?

42:02.120 --> 42:03.080
No.

42:03.840 --> 42:04.920
You're not him.

42:05.000 --> 42:06.280
Who are you?

42:10.880 --> 42:11.880
You forgot me

42:13.360 --> 42:15.040
but fell in love with a part of me.

42:15.800 --> 42:18.560
There are always
so many coincidences in this world.

42:18.640 --> 42:20.240
So ridiculous.

42:20.840 --> 42:22.160
What do you mean?

42:28.240 --> 42:29.960
When I met you,

42:31.360 --> 42:34.200
you had lost all your power
repairing the sky

42:35.400 --> 42:37.560
and couldn't even take human form.

42:43.120 --> 42:44.480
Day after day,

42:45.520 --> 42:47.960
I nourished you
with blood spiritual power.

42:48.600 --> 42:50.000
You used my power to recover,

42:51.640 --> 42:53.840
but at the crucial moment, you betrayed me

42:54.640 --> 42:56.600
and sent me here with your own hands.
